Scribe is made of two kinds of work, under two licenses.

1. The code: MIT License (full text below)

   The Java source code (src/main/java and src/client/java), the data,
   language and configuration files (the .json files outside the model
   folders, the mixin and mod configuration files), and the build files.

2. The art: All Rights Reserved

   The pictures (.png files) and the block and item models
   (src/main/resources/assets/*/models and everything in
   src/main/resources/resourcepacks) are Copyright (c) 2026 Jaubert,
   All Rights Reserved. They may not be copied, changed or shared outside
   of Scribe without written permission. Exceptions:

   - Some pictures are made from Minecraft's own textures. Those parts
     belong to Mojang Studios and are used as the Minecraft EULA and
     Usage Guidelines allow.
   - The strap look of enchanted books uses textures from Enchanted Book
     Redesign by Tfarcenim, dedicated to the public domain (CC0 1.0):
     written_book_strap.png and, in its ribbon_book folder, curse.png,
     level_2.png, level_3.png, level_4.png, level_5.png and ribbon.png,
     all in src/main/resources/assets/scribe/textures/item.

Other files in this repository:

- libs/modmenu-api-stub.jar: two interfaces of Mod Menu's API, used only
  to compile. MIT License, see libs/MODMENU-LICENSE.txt.
- The Gradle wrapper (gradlew, gradlew.bat and gradle/wrapper): Gradle,
  Apache License 2.0.


